# Telemetry Manager (Sanitized)

This document retains a high-level overview of the TelemetryManager role while removing implementation-specific telemetry endpoints.

## Overview
- Coordinates registered telemetry sources and aggregates packets for downstream consumers.
- Exposes polling hooks so other systems can collect pending telemetry data each frame.
- Ensures payloads are normalized before emission.

## Sanitized Notes
- Detailed endpoint names, payload schemas, and integration examples have been removed from this public snapshot.
- Use the internal engineering handbook for full API contracts and secure transport requirements.
- The public release should reference only generic source categories (e.g., gameplay, diagnostics).
